# Implementation Plan - UI Refinement & Animation Polish

We will refine the visual and interactive experience by graduating from a conventional sidebar layout to a high-end "Editorial" interface. This includes adopting floating control islands, staggering mathematical object entrances, and overhauling typography for a more professional "Manim" look.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To achieve a "Manim" feel, we will transition the player controls and sidebar into **Floating Islands**. This maximizes the visible canvas area and creates a more cinematic focus on the math.

> [!TIP]
> We will introduce **Animation Staggering**. Instead of all vectors appearing at once, they will sequence in (e.g., Vector `u`, then Vector `v`, then the Angle).

